    {
      "id": "7346004a-2357-4dfa-af22-c8f4ca5db508",
      "title": "Leia a comparação curta e observe qual expressão combina melhor com algo irritante e qual combina melhor com algo que parece injusto ou inadequado.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "9a122f9f-f1ee-4caa-bd4a-b79e7f381464",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Me molesta que...</strong> soa mais pessoal: destaca aquilo que irrita ou desgasta a convivência no dia a dia.</p><p><strong>No me parece bien que...</strong> avalia a situação: marca que algo parece inadequado, injusto ou fora do acordo.</p><p>Nas duas fórmulas, o foco continua na ação que provoca a reação, por isso elas ajudam a discutir regras de casa com mais controle.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "930cf3fe-2e18-4747-8882-68fd3e4920f8",
      "title": "Quando o incômodo precisa virar acordo",
      "description": "<p>Observe como as duas fórmulas da aula reaparecem em uma conversa curta sobre convivência real.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Podemos hablar un momento de los acuerdos de casa?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Podemos falar um momento sobre os acordos da casa?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d5c7f6abf0514967b995f81cb98fd8f4_b06-d01-podemos-hablar-un-momento-de-los-acuerdos-de-casa.mp3?Expires=1794099830&Signature=FeB60LwrTHAyH4sLsqVDmJwzp-RszACLiBRC1FU~9ZtDW4taBF~KSlMinjrthdIH~VvZo~coWeeItiTP645qXSiMT8e~CqagvxAH0lGO8AZJhhAfCUdOp8Bd0twJ9QRbzVXSo-dLZDcIwuVsiHoYOteM-naAbFPLuzwuv7YbuD39EKFbD3PHY-5RcBXU1flDs6Qv8gN4KzmesgafOvL3xW4wycGAcIiwnhVeHEvE6STRYyKZyLdF2V0Ib1G6S8U8Iw43su-RvMWptIzIVqlkXeMXy8gkRw2Zv99~48yFX0nTKuFYKiAjHHBocdTwJjFvA8gknyyzcDsRSa7VUgwZeQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Sí, claro. ¿Qué te preocupa?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Sim, claro. O que está te preocupando?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/1d003e521aa6496090a66ca8915d9aa0_b06-d02-si-claro-que-te-preocupa.mp3?Expires=1794099830&Signature=i9FWYuCWLRS0Wf8pm3a9LjN2wk3sx50FXZ8eXJYjtGPKjXBShETH8xMFvF~uq88SqQZBfh6-TgTe4CxzONs8O0b30etCsGNfmSwQudDN51Ca6Nu3pf0SZ0hzK82vKlh3eKiCWSYc19jxUIiOMitQRSduoHygfZG87UVz9iVKYWf8shsH8zrX7jXdNjb1cLkAEuajdoCfQpGUoptZbkOhA5ukxN-8GhZFUTjrF-5OQHJc7ASnwHLFe1nHqnQXAt-guhQdwmN9G4wAgNjUU54KqPevG5Vamwuu827BHeed6b0YZb-NWeRUrTSGicQ-a7k7iwQ4MGR0GsdH3LSsSyiSUA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Me molesta que dejen la cocina desordenada después de cenar.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Me incomoda que deixem a cozinha bagunçada depois do jantar.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/66dd56c4bf254b79b72a16063ea16fa1_b02-me-molesta-que-dejen-la-cocina-desordenada-despues-de-cenar.mp3?Expires=1794099830&Signature=h3iC-XASUFHcVFExmjVade8ryJcKPCxhZY7cotW9plH6MLuRy3aMnpHg8rObNwHRR2uCZEDlOeU506hM3lYwI9kTQbPSHPJFRH55ChWiHMM5BWjJQjDjf3f2oGsa2h9qISn7f0eKSgT1Qats-nYkIlDKwZWnaIm18aR9t8f6qeby09TY460RZLJap93GpSO6HVeWngBPgs4B05LkCCXSPyPJuwyufdi2o38rsBYxnD8K9VhQ93ypAh5yQHU1RQnuYsqdnANNb59CSVor-H0I8HM~H4KrCGMyfnJzoS~xFWkevihf3TnxTwLy5S~73egT8CbkyVHj2IOQ8dO0m37Piw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">No me parece bien que cambien los turnos de limpieza sin avisar.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Não me parece certo que mudem os turnos de limpeza sem avisar.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/b92c9a3701cf4fe09087b55949bbe06f_b04-no-me-parece-bien-que-cambien-los-turnos-de-limpieza-sin-avisar.mp3?Expires=1794099830&Signature=F92ARk-H1DX9q5SekLmqYpGRHZRC-E0GjbaWDZn54c2fygHMXB5XtCkAuWwQLmaCgVvr6eTzAtgGXbDTA9HqeMXJm4bBibN1Qt9kR4gzylDUkoWB0GxkEyfH8HGzpHgF6Z15HIAA1UevbFS2qfCKvWz6~8IOzXn7YfppuRPqmC3v1bBrGcluaZSK4HvY1TH5-7pMsBx-IYGuJC16ATMT1J40iLAngPYfMr0TIxrdXp0psY5OQkE0Le1dSmHWMPTsa51Euekh3nIf9UphNDXN8SEw7T43XDQVj8-~Ami1pY1pxVAGRxfjj~zeXgWDnpklcGZJ~GsaCZkI5IWc-JBgGw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Entonces, mejor dejamos todo por escrito.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Então, melhor deixar tudo por escrito.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/fb5a8643416e404cb886b5f2ff8766b4_b06-d05-entonces-mejor-dejamos-todo-por-escrito.mp3?Expires=1794099830&Signature=T7VNyqEsGLg-9Pw7636Rzz~5E-HG1wVNz6UDdGc9UjBGG6M7JrgO-4mkO62QgQV8Gr8Z3EQ-V9MrsZa8~JBzRGsCt01x8G5p1kYFeNKoX-G~TmNszLZ1CsXBO6pCT40PSip2W-UATN~f3jTmdFJasSlDZ5QsImN3Nc7t0gBcIOLp-Y4ZFEdRMsp8HfixmPmJuI3A9~XogJ5uIPys15F~hXs34By6i7WeCo9azPCuWfD3Ppy8DvCO5JNCx9jW~hzwCgPa0-KR85iV4v-gjpSdvdXePENTtclQQ1xXgG8YTjyitTUu6SDUXiQidmI~2hnsheK9RD0O9kv~eP5ympI3BA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
